\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Father, I might have returned to the God of Death's embrace before you...","female":"If not for <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Father, I might have returned to the God of Death's embrace before you...","variant_male_record_index":"250445","variant_female_record_index":"250446","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826062008:1":{"text":"I would sooner not have noticed, and been spared waking to the likes of you, you idle, pampered girl!","source_cn":"吾倒是希望吾觉察不到，免得被你这游手好闲的贵族大小姐吵醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AA13C584A618CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826062009:1":{"text":"Enough. I shall waste no more breath chastising you... Make haste with your recovery, then <style=\"highlight\">purge the outskirts of the Bantus filth</style>.","source_cn":"算了，指责你你也不会听……你还是快些恢复，去<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985CF4085F43BC60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826062010:1":{"text":"They didn't hatch this scheme overnight.","source_cn":"他们这份预谋可不是一日两日了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E619100165A3977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826062012:1":{"text":"I want those wretches driven out at once! Even from here, I can smell their revolting stench!","source_cn":"赶快处理掉，别让他们打搅吾的清静梦！吾在这里都能闻到他...","status":"matched",